3.5 Relationships between Use Cases
Up to this point, we have learned only about relationships between use
cases and actors (associations) and between actors themselves (general-
ization of actors). Use cases can also be in a relationship with other use
cases. Here we differentiate between «include» relationships, «extend»
relationships, and generalizations of use cases.
