38
3 The Use Case Diagram
we must consider whether we want to view these employees as actors
or as part of the student administration system. If they are a part of the
system, they must not be modeled as actors. In that case, some other
entity outside the system should be an actor. If they are not part of the
system but are necessary for the execution of the use cases, they must
be represented as actors—outside the system boundaries.
Figure 3.13
