4. How can a modeler simplify a diagram that contains separate use cases for creating, updating, and deleting the same object?','b66da429-7087-4b99-83b0-368addaa33bf'::uuid,NULL,NULL,51,473,'2026-05-08 16:23:24.135142+07');
