3. In use case modeling, what is the significance of the system boundary regarding the placement of actors?
4. What are the two specific types of relationships mentioned that allow one use case to access the functionality of another?','dab17a39-da59-477e-ad11-0e0c21b8c0d7'::uuid,NULL,NULL,57,759,'2026-05-08 16:23:24.13583+07');
