4. In the provided code examples, how does the subclass B change the behavior of method ''f()'' from its parent class A?','90e663c3-2454-40f1-9652-2a37a5ee10c3'::uuid,NULL,NULL,6,264,'2026-05-08 16:24:56.701891+07');
