3. According to the lecture hall example, what triggers the transition from the ''free'' state to the ''occupied'' state?
4. How does the level of detail in a state machine diagram change as a project moves from requirements collection to the late development phase?','58484f2a-b5a1-429c-b329-ca1ae582c473'::uuid,NULL,NULL,95,737,'2026-05-08 16:23:24.140656+07');
