3. How does the reaching of a final state within a composite state affect the behavior of the higher-level state?
4. Under what specific conditions is an event considered ''lost'' when a system is in a nested substate?','efed3153-8a1f-4371-8f45-e116e1a1a33e'::uuid,NULL,NULL,106,842,'2026-05-08 16:23:24.142214+07');
