2. Why are lightweight extensions preferred for maintaining interoperability between different modeling tools?
3. What components can be added to a metaclass using a stereotype?
4. How is the extension relationship between a stereotype and a metaclass visually represented in a diagram?','7a9ed00f-3174-4857-9a66-aacd4d78f0ed'::uuid,NULL,NULL,199,997,'2026-05-08 16:23:24.152973+07');
