4. How does the Command Pattern help in decoupling the invoker of a computation from the object that performs it?','da49713b-3e58-44dd-aab9-6d0fe7eacc4b'::uuid,NULL,NULL,18,771,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.914136+07');
