you are here 4    3
intro to design patterns
Joe
All subclasses
inherit fly().
What Joe added.
The executives decided that flying ducks is just what the
simulator needs to blow away the competitors. And of course
Joe’s manager told them it’ll be no problem for Joe to just
whip something up in a week. “After all,” said Joe’s boss,
“he’s an OO programmer…how hard can it be?”
But now we need the ducks to FLY
Other Duck types...
Duck
quack()
swim()
display()
fly()
