meeting moved to Saturday night.
We’re going to be talking about the
Observer Pattern. That pattern is
the best! It’s the BEST, Jerry!

=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces the Observer Pattern, a fundamental design pattern used to keep objects informed when events of interest occur. It highlights that the pattern is based on a one-to-many relationship and emphasizes the importance of loose coupling. By using this pattern, objects can be automatically notified of changes, ensuring they stay synchronized with the data they care about without being tightly integrated into the source of the change.

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
1. What is the primary function of the Observer Pattern according to the text?
2. What kind of relationship does the Observer Pattern establish between objects?
3. What are the two key concepts mentioned that will be explored regarding the Observer Pattern?
4. Based on the text, why is the Observer Pattern considered a highly useful design pattern?','7b028058-5f0e-4dcb-94d8-be4734b61e64'::uuid,NULL,NULL,75,409,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.920178+07');
