acquires the most recent measurements.
Further, this is an expandable weather station. Weather-O-
Rama wants to allow other developers to write their own
weather displays and plug them right in. So it’s important that
new displays will be easy to add in the future.
Weather-O-Rama thinks we have a great business model: once
the customers are hooked, we intend to charge them for each
