=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces a contract to build an internet-based Weather Monitoring Station for Weather-O-Rama, Inc. The system relies on a WeatherData object to track temperature, humidity, and pressure. Requirements include creating three initial displays (current conditions, statistics, and forecast) that update in real time. A critical design goal is extensibility, ensuring that third-party developers can easily create and plug in new display elements. This setup establishes the practical need for the Observer Pattern to manage dynamic updates across multiple components.

