4. Between ''push'' and ''pull'' methods of data transfer in the Observer Pattern, which is considered more correct?','d7fd0f23-7df0-4f25-9835-25b218677795'::uuid,NULL,NULL,110,753,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.923601+07');
