=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces the concept of ''class explosion'' through the Starbuzz Coffee example. It demonstrates the maintenance nightmare created when using traditional inheritance to handle every possible combination of a product (coffee) and its various additions (condiments like soy, mocha, and whip). By creating a unique subclass for every variant, the system becomes overly complex and rigid. This scenario highlights the limitations of using inheritance for dynamic behavior extension, setting the stage for more efficient design patterns like the Decorator Pattern.

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
