=== SUMMARY ===
This segment discusses an attempt to solve ''class explosion'' by using boolean instance variables in the Beverage superclass to track condiments. While this reduces the number of classes, it creates a maintenance nightmare. The superclass handles condiment costs, while subclasses add the base drink cost. This design is flawed because any change in condiment prices or the addition of new toppings requires modifying existing code, violating key design principles regarding encapsulation and inheritance.

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
