4. According to the text, why is using instance variables in the superclass to manage changing requirements considered a violation of good design principles?','5b455d60-407b-4d85-9186-322cb3fa385a'::uuid,NULL,NULL,120,610,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.924389+07');
