=== SUMMARY ===
This segment illustrates the implementation of the Abstract Factory pattern through the NYPizzaIngredientFactory. By implementing the PizzaIngredientFactory interface, this concrete factory defines how to create a specific family of regional ingredients, such as ThinCrustDough and FreshClams. It demonstrates how different product families are encapsulated within separate factory subclasses, allowing the system to remain decoupled from the specific classes of objects it creates, while ensuring that ingredients used together are compatible with the specific regional style (New York).

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
