=== SUMMARY ===
This segment explains how the ClamPizza class utilizes the Abstract Factory pattern to source its ingredients. By composing the pizza with a PizzaIngredientFactory, the prepare() method can request components like dough and sauce without needing to know their specific regional implementations. This architectural choice decouples the Pizza class from regional differences, allowing it to be reused across various cities (like New York or Chicago) simply by providing a different concrete factory that handles local ingredient variations such as fresh or frozen clams.

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
