3. Why should developers avoid the double-checked locking implementation in Java versions older than Java 5?
4. What is suggested as a modern and simple way to implement Singletons in Java to avoid issues like synchronization and class loading?','fc56f0ad-e2dc-46d5-a47c-99231d44328b'::uuid,NULL,NULL,224,920,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.935029+07');
