2. What are the two primary types of buttons available for each individual slot?
3. What is the specific function of the global button located at the bottom of the remote?
4. Based on the text, how are users expected to keep track of which device is assigned to which slot on the physical hardware?','e405ce7e-379b-4a1e-aec5-16c5096ad0a6'::uuid,NULL,NULL,231,392,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.935668+07');
