4. Based on the text, how does the Command Pattern simplify the execution of complex sequences of actions for the invoker?','2d984eb9-82ac-4aae-86ae-a091a20a314f'::uuid,NULL,NULL,249,676,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.937517+07');
