4. Besides adapting interfaces, what is the other primary function of object wrapping mentioned regarding the second pattern in this chapter?','50526c7f-0327-4586-b4c7-1f7bdec1aa29'::uuid,NULL,NULL,275,523,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.940197+07');
