3. Why is logging individual commands preferable to saving the entire state of a large data structure like a spreadsheet?
4. In what way can command logging techniques be extended for advanced transactional applications?','560a14b3-2091-4137-8e95-f0c9b1d0903e'::uuid,NULL,NULL,268,753,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.939531+07');
