your code against. This isn’t going to work!
The adapter implements the
interface your classes expect...
...and talks to the vendor interface
to service your requests.
No code changes.
No code changes.
New code.
Can you think of a solution
that doesn’t require YOU to
write ANY additional code
to integrate the new vendor
classes? How about making the
vendor supply the adapter class?
Vendor
Class
Adapter
Your
Existing
