3. How does the adapter class interact with both the client system and the vendor library?
4. What alternative solution is suggested to avoid writing any additional integration code yourself?','f3f4135a-4086-4480-abba-b4f6f4015de2'::uuid,NULL,NULL,277,561,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.940399+07');
