3. How does the TurkeyAdapter resolve the difference between a Duck''s quack and a Turkey''s gobble?
4. Why does the TurkeyAdapter call the turkey.fly() method five times within its own fly() implementation?','b42af671-b984-4be4-9cb2-f1871f83e50e'::uuid,NULL,NULL,279,603,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.940582+07');
