2. In what way does the Adapter Pattern use object composition to enhance design flexibility?
3. What is the primary advantage of binding a client to an interface rather than a specific implementation in this pattern?
4. How does the use of an Adapter help in maintaining code when the underlying vendor or class interface changes over time?','1f58a92b-50b6-461f-a649-3aac558f6153'::uuid,NULL,NULL,283,691,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.940997+07');
