API. Where would you like to have a few new ones?

=== SUMMARY ===
This segment demonstrates the implementation of a Facade''s simplified interface. By grouping complex sequences of subsystem operations—such as managing the projector, lights, and audio—into single methods like watchMovie() and endMovie(), the Facade delegates specific tasks to individual components. This approach hides the complexity of the subsystem from the client, providing a high-level, easy-to-use API. It illustrates the core benefit of the Facade Pattern: providing a convenient entry point while delegating actual work to the underlying classes.

