=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces the Template Method Pattern through the CaffeineBeverage class. A template method, such as prepareRecipe(), defines the overarching structure of an algorithm by sequencing various steps as method calls. While the base class implements common steps like boiling water, it declares specific steps as abstract methods. This allows subclasses to provide custom implementations for those specific steps without changing the algorithm''s structure, ensuring consistency while maintaining flexibility for different beverage types.

