3. In the java.io.InputStream example provided, which specific method acts as the template method?
4. Which design principle did the implementers of the sorting algorithm choose to favor by avoiding traditional inheritance, and what were the trade-offs?','50d8d446-213e-41e3-918a-2438f9fa7c28'::uuid,NULL,NULL,345,904,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.946855+07');
