and return true or false,
depending on the input.
This code asks if the user would like milk and
sugar and gets the input from the command line.

=== SUMMARY ===
This segment demonstrates the implementation of a ''hook'' within the Template Method pattern. By overriding the customerWantsCondiments() method in the CoffeeWithHook subclass, the developer provides specific logic to control the flow of the algorithm defined in the abstract superclass. In this example, the hook uses command-line input to let the user decide if condiments should be added. This illustrates how hooks allow subclasses to conditionally influence an algorithm''s steps without being forced to implement them if not needed.

