3. List at least three methods that must be implemented as part of the Java-Enabled Waitress Specification.
4. According to the text, what specific functionality allows the waitress to provide information without consulting the cook?','b0ea1c0e-eab3-4a67-ba83-e0f9188667c0'::uuid,NULL,NULL,360,575,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.94847+07');
