=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces a technical conflict resulting from the merger of Objectville Diner and Objectville Pancake House. While both restaurants agree on the ''MenuItem'' class, they use different data structures to store them: Lou uses an ArrayList, while Mel uses a standard Array. Neither party wants to change their implementation due to existing code dependencies. This scenario illustrates a common problem in software design: how to provide a uniform way to iterate over different collection types without forcing a change in their internal storage mechanisms.

