fixing the waitress

=== SUMMARY ===
This segment explains how to refactor the Waitress class using the Iterator pattern. By introducing an overloaded printMenu(Iterator) method, the Waitress can iterate through different menu implementations (arrays or lists) using a single, unified loop. This hides the internal representation of menu items from the client, reducing code redundancy and improving encapsulation. The Waitress now relies on the Iterator interface''s hasNext() and next() methods to retrieve and display MenuItem details, making the code more flexible and easier to maintain.

