3. Why is the dispense() method called within turnCrank() instead of being a public method accessible by the user?
4. What role does the releaseBall() method play in the interaction between the GumballMachine and the various State objects?','1a25b319-7c50-4e01-9e8c-ee18ba910ba5'::uuid,NULL,NULL,437,800,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.957472+07');
