=== SUMMARY ===
This segment illustrates how the State Pattern facilitates adding new functionality, specifically a 1-in-10 chance game. By modifying the HasQuarterState to include a random number generator, the machine can now transition to a newly created WinnerState. If a user wins and sufficient inventory exists, they are moved to the WinnerState; otherwise, the machine proceeds to the standard SoldState. This demonstrates that with the State Pattern, new features require minimal changes to existing logic, typically involving only new states and specific transition updates.

