4. Based on the introduction, why might a developer choose to use a proxy instead of allowing direct access to an object?','2e16018c-9df2-433d-bdba-8c65b1d58fb1'::uuid,NULL,NULL,463,422,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.960051+07');
