=== SUMMARY ===
This segment details the design of a Virtual Proxy for an album cover application. It explains how ImageProxy implements the Icon interface to manage an expensive ImageIcon object. The proxy improves user experience by displaying a ''loading'' message while image data is retrieved over the network. Once the image is fully loaded, the proxy delegates all interface method calls to the real ImageIcon. This pattern effectively handles latency and resource-intensive object creation without blocking the user interface.

