3. How does the ImageProxy notify the system that the image is ready to be displayed after retrieval?
4. What would happen to the user interface if the ImageIcon was instantiated directly inside the paintIcon() method?','2812be04-8e0f-40e4-ad7a-244a5ab1b04e'::uuid,NULL,NULL,500,471,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.963798+07');
