3. In the quack() method of QuackCounter, what happens immediately before the numberOfQuacks variable is incremented?
4. Why is it necessary for the QuackCounter class to implement the Quackable interface?','7cbc5b0d-bb3e-4797-a657-c2b1be985dc4'::uuid,NULL,NULL,538,548,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.967349+07');
