=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces the Model-View-Controller (MVC) compound pattern through song lyrics. MVC factors code into three functional layers to enhance reusability and maintain clean boundaries. The Model represents the application''s data and logic within the problem domain. The View handles the display and user interaction, remaining independent of the specific data it presents to keep coupling loose. The Controller acts as a mediator, synchronizing state and data flow between the Model and View. Together, these layers form a powerful structure for managing complex applications.

