=== SUMMARY ===
This segment introduces the concrete BeatModel class, which implements the BeatModelInterface and Runnable. It manages the application state (BPM) and audio playback logic. Using the Observer Pattern, it maintains separate lists for Beat and BPM observers, notifying them whenever a beat occurs or the frequency changes. A dedicated thread handles the timing of the beats by sleeping for a duration calculated from the current BPM, allowing the model to generate a steady rhythm while remaining responsive to controller inputs.

