=== SUMMARY ===
This segment illustrates how to integrate the Model-View-Controller components using the DJTestDrive class. By instantiating a BeatModel and passing it to the BeatController, the application is initialized, with the controller handling the view''s creation. The text emphasizes the functional synergy of the MVC pattern: the model manages data, the view observes the model for updates, and the controller handles user input and UI state logic (like enabling buttons) to keep the components decoupled yet synchronized.

=== REVIEW QUESTIONS ===
1. In the provided DJTestDrive code, why is the view not explicitly instantiated in the main method?
