3. What advice does the author give regarding the use of the ''simplest solution'' versus using a design pattern?
4. What is the definition of the ''State'' pattern as provided in the OO Patterns list?','dba3014b-6a73-4ef3-ba90-2b3596906a2f'::uuid,NULL,NULL,632,1163,'2026-05-08 16:43:33.977439+07');
